#: scenario2:scenario2_111F5064_ADFE_466A_A14C_A75FD5928ADF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f63c2c57bb5c3a3c96cfbe2c615d0637f98d4af82f43c37f1c95dd144472e403
#. default-sha256: c94ca47fe2928a88aaf3010f9f38517f00ded359f9755c63469cef1afbb9e42e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_111F5064_ADFE_466A_A14C_A75FD5928ADF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫...Master. Master."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫……주인님, ⟪k:9⟫주인님."

#: scenario2:scenario2_11F56EE0_9C38_4F29_B74A_6FCC8A325BC3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 76821b3de937f3b796329244dc462802c36d8d2d0275483d9578ea97bab60dea
#. default-sha256: 12d2565a41386c6b86276c48fa4ca5c0b19117a93e41adfafa43464ad4ae71ed
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_11F56EE0_9C38_4F29_B74A_6FCC8A325BC3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Ahh... ⟪k:1⟫you have awakened. ⟪k:2⟫You gave me quite the startle."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아아…… 정신이 드셨군요?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫제가 ⟪k:3⟫깜짝 놀랐답니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_89EE87C6_5B9A_4A0A_A1DF_5919B15040CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b8e7d206bd3fdce7c7a05164ca6effe1811c22b127a104f00be295b28b394514
#. default-sha256: 4d06d042d20d140ba26e5561deb9316bce93f89dbeda1fa8eb0399579edc5636
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_89EE87C6_5B9A_4A0A_A1DF_5919B15040CC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Do you not remember? ⟪k:1⟫You suddenly started staring off into the distance, and you would "
"not respond to anything I said."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫기억이 안 나시는지요? ⟪k:1⟫갑자기 눈이 멍해지시더니 ⟪k:2⟫제 말씀을 듣지 않으셨는데요."

#: scenario2:scenario2_1CC76CC7_F747_47C2_8887_23081832279C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8b38da45ec76290f2d0a75b68621abc667ddf80e0201b8bcca36e3ab6486119a
#. default-sha256: 9604f7d5c105f9f1b420c31c007dcbd0508572163d91f654540818da10a97483
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_1CC76CC7_F747_47C2_8887_23081832279C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Hehe. I thought you were playing a prank on me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫후후, ⟪k:1⟫장난이라도 치시나 싶었답니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_1AD64425_BDF5_4EA6_9999_FD49546236A4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e52bee0f65e20cf4ffbfe16dffec245b62df6032f2a05429c652bb2e92a739fa
#. default-sha256: 325b9c3674bcd2102b568cf18001285ee058c129c5a02a2f5cce38da59f45f19
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_1AD64425_BDF5_4EA6_9999_FD49546236A4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Your hand? ⟪k:1⟫Oh, yes, I did not let go of it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫손⟪k:1⟫이요? ⟪k:2⟫네, ⟪k:3⟫쭉 잡고 있었지요."

#: scenario2:scenario2_1A399BDF_5BE1_4A36_AB0A_D560CD523861
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bcf5dc339a1f4e7c40839fe57390786a8300aa568ea0452846253e5b5ba2d1a2
#. default-sha256: 0bc8b07188598200dfd566fa78dd8e06837d9fd6feaedf4016c975a99934d9c4
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_1A399BDF_5BE1_4A36_AB0A_D560CD523861"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫For if I had, we would be in quite the predicament."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……제가 ⟪k:1⟫주인님의 손을 놓으면 ⟪k:2⟫큰일이 나니까요."

#: scenario2:scenario2_F848F63F_7A17_4B90_B2F5_A318014EACD6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9c682f180f0a0733bba4e99c4ae2c52e3863cff8ceae6a5e21ea691148949dff
#. default-sha256: 34ebf24cf47a97b0cbc9eaa0078180b730b5aac96fa0c30da8f03fe123170758
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_F848F63F_7A17_4B90_B2F5_A318014EACD6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Someone approaching the mansion, you say? ⟪k:1⟫You saw them?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫어머…… ⟪k:1⟫누가 저택에 접근하려 한다고요? ⟪k:2⟫그 광경을 보셨단 건지요?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_A1598863_CBF6_41E4_BCFE_3F9793B411E7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a4b990b825eaf80cc5587d3510f00f8c05acf55bb7a978cd8f81a0e5374fd74a
#. default-sha256: 7b356c957bf28b8ed848b5b989ae3e8f4036162e9f2a4c8028c8f2b108544fd8
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A1598863_CBF6_41E4_BCFE_3F9793B411E7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Those images... ⟪k:1⟫were not shown to you by me. ⟪k:2⟫If you saw something, then it was by "
"your own powers."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그건…… ⟪k:1⟫제가 보여 드린 게 아니랍니다. ⟪k:2⟫주인님께서 무언가를 보셨다면, ⟪k:3⟫그건 ⟪k:4⟫"
"주인님의 힘."

#: scenario2:scenario2_71F90BF4_07DD_4E07_A132_1B71D3313736
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 23c08af5d29c08941e7007d875dcf0c5aa328897c012b8a6ca578759c45074bb
#. default-sha256: 5642606ceb5276a88b5fb8c857db29fca874b809619f5946b215c69cd63064c3
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_71F90BF4_07DD_4E07_A132_1B71D3313736"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But if you think about it, that is nothing unusual."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만 ⟪k:1⟫생각해 보면 이상할 건 없지요."

#: scenario2:scenario2_2BC8B724_D335_4767_B5CD_FCB8966C49A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8c206877d25bdb1135154138eb3ea6d24a3c1b05f0feaf2777e64595c057d887
#. default-sha256: 70b5e5aeb15af9172b04ff959f7b1677b60170403bd20520561f3fedbe9615b8
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2BC8B724_D335_4767_B5CD_FCB8966C49A9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You are, after all, the master of this house."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫당신은 ⟪k:1⟫저택의 주인이니까요."

#: scenario2:scenario2_1B8C40FB_85CC_4FE2_AC7E_E24F642F5E44
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 55c32f03aa7bf78fe1840f6918a6a778f491a94cef5eeb4ea1e4c5f92573a080
#. default-sha256: 4a2b5a74529cc2777376b4d530a06ff0a1d5f4b9257393609fb5eb33ecac5681
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_1B8C40FB_85CC_4FE2_AC7E_E24F642F5E44"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You should, in all actuality, be able to do anything I can do by yourself, Master."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫제가 가능한 건 ⟪k:1⟫따지고 보면 ⟪k:2⟫주인님 혼자서도 가능하답니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_7E71B94D_DC7F_4E9D_A51F_AD26D219E9FC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3694e3081c2537e7c8e45539042c9060431278ef87bde2ea6fff4e5a1dabf4a4
#. default-sha256: 4d300eda28bbb6446c893ee047bb657f7aab1908f683a429292013b38558a79a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7E71B94D_DC7F_4E9D_A51F_AD26D219E9FC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So it is very possible you could have knowledge that I do not."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그러니…… ⟪k:1⟫제가 모르는 걸 주인님께서 아시는 것도 ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫마냥 불가능한 건 아닙니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_6E2FABCA_9F64_48A0_B7E6_6CD0ADBD4555
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 491ec8e5887f1b766f8b5ed8212220ca12a611d9bad5a034190ca2486e4e88d5
#. default-sha256: 05482cf30c0da5a751f2c23928763f08e19abc40fe2a00d329638c756d94d87e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_6E2FABCA_9F64_48A0_B7E6_6CD0ADBD4555"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Now, let us return to the mansion’s tale."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫자, ⟪k:1⟫저택 이야기로 돌아가시지요."

#: scenario2:scenario2_0F1BEE93_B1C4_4A09_B39D_E7D9E7B6F528
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f9294a1f130019034783027f14fa26585788ecaab556714ca003ad4b351856bf
#. default-sha256: 680f25351a6e4f95870cc2ff65b5eeca47a277b3b1141a14d94d5c1e5ce98fcf
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_0F1BEE93_B1C4_4A09_B39D_E7D9E7B6F528"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫After the second beast paid a visit, Bestia began to destabilize again."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫베스티아와 똑같은 짐승이 나타난 이후, ⟪k:1⟫베스티아는 또 불안정해졌습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_9192764E_EBB3_456D_8944_942876725FB3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7e5afd547b9fb4d204a6082c40eb0702601ca69ca802458c0d05593d70f7dea6
#. default-sha256: 008008db4b8ec7f9af9ac196f4226b1de7b38d31f36d57680e0f16121db08054
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_9192764E_EBB3_456D_8944_942876725FB3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl would soothe his heart, but the calm was only ephemeral."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫백발 소녀가 베스티아의 마음을 달래도, ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫침착해지는 건 잠깐으로 그쳤지요."

#: scenario2:scenario2_E9596033_9464_4E27_AE7A_5F6978E107B7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2396ae3800bec5e4464a1f58315a0c5f750b2698e5889d5a4f4586a1577b1766
#. default-sha256: d8aa6278666ccc0cdcf40773659eba8c3bc2629d17ca6f1edb9187dc98e452ee
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E9596033_9464_4E27_AE7A_5F6978E107B7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He was like a cracked glass ball."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫베스티아는 ⟪k:1⟫금이 간 유리 구슬 같았습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A0605F8E_692A_4C13_9EBC_6804BCFE93B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e1cb13f0569f0fb597d6a5743a7746d26343a2d9d1169e2a82a5675222716f6
#. default-sha256: 6d43f2a0e41d86c04c5a1f4ea84fcf4677ed93cf1e4e8ae9a067f4cb8c37f77e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A0605F8E_692A_4C13_9EBC_6804BCFE93B3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If you dropped him, that would be the end. ⟪k:1⟫If you put too much force into handling him, "
"he would shatter. ⟪k:2⟫He was very difficult to care for."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫떨어트린 순간 끝, ⟪k:1⟫힘을 주기만 해도 깨지는 등―― ⟪k:2⟫몹시 다루기 힘든 유리 구슬."

#: scenario2:scenario2_0B4F9443_56C3_456D_B951_B6010DA695FE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea8fe4aae9267c908784723fb48cf921ecc146506bc68f6c4cc2992e0b430d44
#. default-sha256: 1a1ce1b626935aa75f208066b849e340113efd39d21a2b36d315162e2710dc62
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_0B4F9443_56C3_456D_B951_B6010DA695FE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And cracks do not heal. ⟪k:1⟫The damage still remains, even if the two sides appear to be "
"held together firmly in place."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫또한, ⟪k:1⟫금이 간 건 수복이 안 된답니다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫붙은 것처럼 보여도 흔적이 남지요."

#: scenario2:scenario2_5A7A7FC0_467A_41A0_9F25_8AB72A3349B6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d5b33b94c523242353fa74eaf84615c621da57e9fcfee8a827d922e29f38c29
#. default-sha256: fb8dd07eb86e6f2400a8c17be3602954509912387cc9da12444ad10ffb396022
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_5A7A7FC0_467A_41A0_9F25_8AB72A3349B6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Furthermore, they slowly, gradually, and without intervention spread."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그건 ⟪k:1⟫야금야금 ⟪k:2⟫자연스럽게 넓어지는 법."

#: scenario2:scenario2_F3BEFB24_9F16_4AFE_BBF4_CCCC02D9858D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 37899bc4fb326411291157376238c4bf5e1426c1fd8f9fe3b54c709e65d803cb
#. default-sha256: b48fd7e564acb0cf5c61b8839bdaf3ab678f47f123c6c065cd293008efc105f7
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_F3BEFB24_9F16_4AFE_BBF4_CCCC02D9858D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The beast appeared to be afraid of someone’s voice."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫짐승은 ⟪k:1⟫누군가의 목소리를 두려워하는 것 같았습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_3CCE8F83_81C4_47D8_99D2_C77A99D5C210
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 21f721b60f882e9372a072bc3b0a9c773adbba76febde622e2dd33af60076934
#. default-sha256: 09b2907f663cc9c7dd7498a4874466f6d5a55e7d7ef907c835359beaf194d797
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3CCE8F83_81C4_47D8_99D2_C77A99D5C210"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He would on occasion stare into empty space and shout, cover his ears, and groan."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이따금 허공에 대고 호통을 치더니, ⟪k:1⟫귀를 틀어막고 ⟪k:2⟫신음했습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_3602D6A7_C211_42BD_B283_E0DEACB10FD7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 42e9f2cc5d5a98e61f6eb5ad2c755b21d28fad06245fba58b914fd55710dceda
#. default-sha256: bc71727c84fb3b581a6484ccd4287530d43e0dbff94125ecdcb8b6b15153c154
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3602D6A7_C211_42BD_B283_E0DEACB10FD7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫One day, he shattered all the windows in the mansion, crushed the silverware I had just "
"polished to a shine..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그러다가 저택 창문을 깨려 했고, ⟪k:1⟫제가 공들여 깔끔하게 만든 식기를 부수었으며……"

#: scenario2:scenario2_E717A328_7A1E_4C98_AEC3_5BA798EE0BCD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd815a49bc7a6592027f16d8acd4a7290399370becb079476947e5e828ac342e
#. default-sha256: 384b53150cddef9a220c2be00873bf83e920bbbad214def3c16627296964fca8
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E717A328_7A1E_4C98_AEC3_5BA798EE0BCD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and destroyed all the mirrors."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아, ⟪k:1⟫거울도 깨트렸지요."

#: scenario2:scenario2_3D6268C8_5E43_4895_85B3_41C34C8C23E7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 898388ca918bf69aaa6781ab4e3fe30b5d8ff78fe176800c4399e439bf680579
#. default-sha256: e645664c687a44f4c9826f5933ee1ded86d9b15fef4d756acfe73a3674cd0b65
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3D6268C8_5E43_4895_85B3_41C34C8C23E7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I assume he did not want to see his beastly self."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫짐승인 ⟪k:1⟫자기 모습을―― ⟪k:2⟫보기 싫었던 걸 겁니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_E6660BE9_C4A9_4F2A_900C_9387CC154EA2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4c7b356fca6e9bc43ef90e340e94ae4353573a8212275d55d0be6e015cc0eac8
#. default-sha256: 388b6a4e583e23820064eea8f8edd473480e3691b4868887adb6dcc77801c1ce
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E6660BE9_C4A9_4F2A_900C_9387CC154EA2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫More... ⟪k:10⟫There’s more!⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫There’s "
"still more that reflects my image!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫아직……, ⟪k:10⟫더 있어! ⟪k:11⟫아직도…… ⟪k:12⟫나"
"를 비추는 게 있다!"

#: scenario2:scenario2_0E8A774D_89D2_40BB_B08E_32EBA92EA1AD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d3b70cf43b068ece7cd7b0fd2fc4432c26e3215c99ca1c28cb901db08570bf24
#. default-sha256: fb557ff26a434666b9871319959a4f17e7ee7eb6194f73121846d280e8974379
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_0E8A774D_89D2_40BB_B08E_32EBA92EA1AD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Windows! Mirrors! Vases! Dishes!⟪k:1⟫They all show my reflection!"
